column19:
Whenever Tune is gathered, choose by current song:
  - Classical: if there atleast 2 other allied entities adjacent to Tune, he gains 1 money;
  - Rock: deal 1 damage to every adjacent entity;
  - Jazz: you may move Tune or an adjacent allied entity by up to 2 tiles;

column21:
Choose by current song:
  - Classical: Tune attacks for X damage within reach, where X is the amount of adjacent allied entities plus 1;
  - Rock:  deal 1 damage to every adjacent enemy entity;
  - Jazz: for every allied adjacent unit, you may move it up to 2 tiles;
